# Keep the build context small and avoid baking unused data into the
# image. Paths are listed explicitly (not a blanket "data/*" + negation)
# because Docker, like git, won't look inside a directory once a pattern
# above has excluded it wholesale -- an exact-path list is what actually
# works, not a broad exclude some later "!" tries to carve exceptions out of.

data/raw
data/processed
data/processed_experiments
# The full processed splits are gitignored (2GB) and not used by the image --
# it bakes in data/demo_sample/ instead. Exclude them from the build context
# so a build on a machine that does have them stays fast.
data/processed_w50
data/mininet_demo
data/gns3_demo
data/nids.db

artifacts/preprocessing
artifacts/preprocessing_experiments
artifacts/models/experiments
artifacts/models/optuna-fpr1pct
artifacts/models/optuna-denoising-50/threshold_analysis.json

Dataset

.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache

.git
tests
documentation
scripts

*.log
.DS_Store
